{"sha": "a3abfc4dd01914889da5893702cf3657dcfcb26c1741958216e56d9e71650595", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses} 章 --- 镜子与薄透镜}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:1}", "$\\overline{SF} = \\qty{-20}{cm}$；$1/\\overline{SA'} = 1/\\overline{SF} -", "1/\\overline{SA}$。当 \\qty{60}{cm} 时：$\\overline{SA'} = \\qty{-30}{cm}$，", "实像，$\\gamma = -0.5$。当 \\qty{30}{cm} 时：$\\overline{SA'} = \\qty{-60}{cm}$，", "实像，$\\gamma = -2$。当 \\qty{10}{cm} 时：$1/\\overline{SA'} = -1/20 + 1/10", "= 1/20$，$\\overline{SA'} = \\qty{+20}{cm}$，位于镜后，虚像，", "$\\gamma = +2$（正立、放大）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:2}", "$\\overline{OA} = \\qty{-20}{cm}$：$1/\\overline{OA'} = 1/5 - 1/20 = 3/20$，", "$\\overline{OA'} = \\qty{+6.7}{cm}$，实像、倒立，$\\gamma = -1/3$。", "$\\overline{OA} = \\qty{-3.0}{cm}$：$1/\\overline{OA'} = 1/5 - 1/3 = -2/15$，", "$\\overline{OA'} = \\qty{-7.5}{cm}$，虚像、正立，$\\gamma = +2.5$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:3}", "$V = 1/0.25 = \\qty{+4.0}{\\delta}$；$f' = 1/(-2.0) = \\qty{-50}{cm}$；", "$V = 3.0 - 1.0 = \\qty{+2.0}{\\delta}$，$f' = \\qty{50}{cm}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:4}", "$\\overline{FA} = \\qty{-15}{cm}$：$\\overline{F'A'} = -f'^2/\\overline{FA}", "= +100/15 = \\qty{6.7}{cm}$，位于 $F'$ 之后，即 $\\overline{OA'} = \\qty{16.7}{cm}$；", "$\\gamma = f'/\\overline{FA} = -0.67$。按笛卡儿符号约定：$\\overline{OA} =", "\\qty{-25}{cm}$，$1/\\overline{OA'} = 1/10 - 1/25 = 3/50$，", "$\\overline{OA'} = \\qty{16.7}{cm}$，$\\gamma = 16.7/(-25) = -0.67$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:5}", "$\\overline{SF} = \\qty{+1.0}{m}$，$\\overline{SA} = \\qty{-20}{m}$：", "$1/\\overline{SA'} = 1 + 1/20$，$\\overline{SA'} = \\qty{0.95}{m}$，位于镜后", "（虚像、正立）；$\\gamma = -0.95/(-20) = +0.048$，像高", "\\qty{7.1}{cm}。大脑依据视大小判断距离：一辆", "车在 \\qty{0.95}{m} 处缩小二十倍，会被误读为", "远处的车 --- 远于 \\qty{20}{m}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:6}", "$1/\\overline{OA'} = 1/50 - 1/2000 = \\qty{0.0195}{mm^{-1}}$，", "$\\overline{OA'} = \\qty{51.3}{mm}$：透镜应向远离", "感光元件的方向移动 \\qty{1.3}{mm}。$\\gamma = 51.3/(-2000) = -0.026$。若要 $\\abs\\gamma = 24/1800", "= 1/75$，则 $\\overline{OA} = f'(1/\\gamma - 1) = 50 \\times (-76) =", "\\qty{-3.8}{m}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:7}", "$\\gamma = -1.8/0.036 = -50$；$\\overline{OA'} = \\qty{5.0}{m}$，", "$\\overline{OA} = \\overline{OA'}/\\gamma = \\qty{-10}{cm}$；", "$1/f' = 1/5.0 + 1/0.10 = \\qty{10.2}{m^{-1}}$，$f' = \\qty{98}{mm}$。", "像倒立（$\\gamma < 0$），上下、左右方向都颠倒，幻灯片", "应旋转 $180^\\circ$ 放入。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:8}", "物位于焦平面 $\\Rightarrow$ 每个点发出的光线经透镜后", "变为平行光；平面镜将其平行地反射回去（沿对称", "方向）；透镜把平行光束会聚在焦平面上，位于", "与物点关于光轴对称的点上：像位于物平面内，", "倒立，$\\gamma = -1$。平面镜倾斜 $\\alpha$ 角时，", "返回光束转过 $2\\alpha$，像横向平移", "$2\\alpha f'$，但仍在同一平面内清晰成像。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:9}", "$f' = (100^2 - 40^2)/(4 \\times 100) = \\qty{21}{cm}$。物像间最短距离", "为 $4f' = \\qty{84}{cm}$，此时 $\\gamma = -1$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:10}", "$L_1$ 将无穷远处成像于 $F_1'$，位于 $L_1$ 之后 \\qty{20}{cm}，即", "位于 $L_2$ 之后 \\qty{5}{cm}：虚物，$\\overline{O_2A_1} = \\qty{+5}{cm}$。", "$1/\\overline{O_2A'} = -1/10 + 1/5 = 1/10$：最终像位于", "$L_2$ 之后 \\qty{10}{cm}。中间像高 $h_1 = f_1'\\alpha = 20\\alpha$（cm）；", "$\\gamma_2 = 10/5 = 2$，故 $h = 40\\alpha$：等效焦距", "为 \\qty{40}{cm}，镜筒长 $15 + 10 = \\qty{25}{cm}$ --- 这是一种长焦镜头。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:11}", "$\\gamma = -3 = -\\overline{SA'}/\\overline{SA}$，得 $\\overline{SA'} =", "3\\overline{SA}$；两者均为实的，位于镜前：$\\overline{SA} = -x$，", "$\\overline{SA'} = -3x$，且屏与灯的距离 $2x = \\qty{80}{cm}$：", "$x = \\qty{40}{cm}$。镜子距灯 \\qty{40}{cm}，", "距屏 \\qty{120}{cm}；$1/\\overline{SF} = -1/40 - 1/120 = -1/30$：", "$R = 2 \\times 30 = \\qty{60}{cm}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:12}", "$\\theta = 0.53^\\circ = \\qty{9.3e-3}{rad}$；像的直径 $f'\\theta =", "\\qty{4.6}{mm}$。会聚功率 $10^3 \\times \\pi(0.05)^2 = \\qty{7.9}{W}$；", "像的面积 $\\pi(2.3\\times10^{-3})^2 = \\qty{1.7e-5}{m^2}$；辐照度", "$\\qty{4.7e5}{W/m^2}$，为直射阳光的 $470$ 倍：纸张炭化并", "燃烧 --- 这就是取火镜。一般地，增益为", "$(D/f'\\theta)^2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:mirrors-thin-lenses:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $1/\\overline{OA'} - 1/\\overline{OA} = 1/f'$，", "$\\gamma = \\overline{OA'}/\\overline{OA}$；光轴沿光的传播方向取向，", "距离自 $O$ 起算并带符号。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $p = -\\overline{OA}$，$\\overline{OA'} = D - p$：", "$1/(D - p) + 1/p = 1/f_1'$，即 $p^2 - Dp + Df_1' = 0$；实根当且仅当", "$D^2 - 4Df_1' \\geq 0$，即 $D \\geq 4f_1'$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 两根之和为 $D$：$p_1 + p_2 = D$，故 $p_2 = D - p_1$ ---", "物距与像距互换，两位置关于", "中点对称。$d = p_2 - p_1 = \\sqrt{D^2 - 4Df_1'}$，因此 $f_1' = (D^2 -", "d^2)/4D$。", ""]}